      "status": "contract_scenario_over_reviewed_fixtures",
      "basis": "The WIN is accepted at 3.75 s and external_mutation locks at 3.78 s. The undo at 6.00 s calls after_undo, which re-locks at 6.03 s, so CLEAR is only banked from 11.25 s and the lock releases at 16.50 s. Without the undo the same frames would release at 14.25 s, which is what step s11 pins. Expectations were derived step by step from ResultDetector.run, ResultStateMachine, ResultGate and server.undo_result, not copied from a replay."
    },
